            "type_local": "花卉市场",
            "notes_base": "Asia's largest fresh-cut flower wholesale and retail market. Open daily 06:00-20:00 (best before noon when freshest). Buy dried flower bouquets and wreaths as take-home souvenirs, also fresh flowers at extremely cheap prices. Flower cakes (鲜花饼) and dried floral gifts available at stalls inside. Per RedNote: fantastic for photography and immersive strolling. Budget ~50-150 CNY for dried flower souvenirs. Avoid packaged tourist gift sets at gates - go inside the main halls for authentic pricing.",
            "notes_local": "亚洲最大鲜切花交易市场，中午前去最新鲜。可买干花花束带回北京，价格超便宜。里面有鲜花饼和干花伴手礼摊位。小红书验证：进主场馆逛，别在门口买游客套装，贵且质量差。",
